### Findings

- Current drawer footer version label lives in `DrawerFooter` and renders `v$versionName`; it is clickable and wired to `onVersionTap` ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):73).
- Settings footer spec explicitly requires display-only behavior: no tap, long-press, About dialog, developer-mode, or side effect ([0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):28).
- Current settings screen is `DesignSettingsScreen`, rendered only for `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot` from `AppShellScreen`, plus its local preview call site ([AppShellScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt):461, [DesignSettingsScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt):298).

### Components

- **DrawerFooter**
  - **Location**: [DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):40
  - **Description**: drawer footer renders footer actions plus version label ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):31).
  - **Uses**: `visibleFooterActions` for action visibility ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):50), `DrawerFooterAction` branches for DesignCatalog/SyncNow/About ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):61).
  - **Used by**: `DrawerContent` calls `DrawerFooter` ([DrawerContent.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerContent.kt):70).
  - **Data flow**: `versionName` parameter → text `"v$versionName"` → clickable `onVersionTap` ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):43, [DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):74, [DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):79).

