  - **Description**: settings screen currently renders design style selection in a `LazyColumn` ([DesignSettingsScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt):58).
