  - **Used by**: `AppShellScreen` renders it for `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot` ([AppShellScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt):461); preview calls it directly ([DesignSettingsScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt):302).
  - **Data flow**: `selectedStyle` + `onStyleSelected` parameters → style options → selection callback ([DesignSettingsScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt):49, [DesignSettingsScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt):70).

### Data flow

- App version name currently starts at app layer: `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` → `AppShellScreen(appVersionName = ...)` ([MainActivity.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt):41).
- App version metadata is declared as `versionCode = 1` and `versionName = "0.1.0"` in the app Gradle config ([build.gradle.kts](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts):16).
- `AppShellScreen` documents that library modules cannot access app `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` directly ([AppShellScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt):107).
- Drawer version flow: `AppShellScreen.appVersionName` → `DrawerContent.versionName` ([AppShellScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt):220).
- Drawer tap flow: drawer text clickable → `rootComponent.onVersionTap(System.currentTimeMillis())` → `DefaultRootComponent.onVersionTap` ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):79, [AppShellScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt):221, [DefaultRootComponent.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt):318).
- Developer behavior flow: `DefaultRootComponent` constructs `ActivateDevModeUseCase` with current developer level and local developer-level write callback ([DefaultRootComponent.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt):140); `onVersionTap` emits `RootEvent.DevModeActivated` or `RootEvent.DevModeAlreadyActive` ([DefaultRootComponent.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/component/DefaultRootComponent.kt):324).
- Settings navigation flow: `DrawerSection.LocalSection.Settings` maps to `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot` ([AppShellTransitions.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt):28), and `SettingsRoot` renders `DesignSettingsScreen` ([AppShellScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt):461).

