### Impact Scan

| Consumer | Assumption | Impact | Severity |
|---|---|---|---|
| Drawer footer version label | Expects only `versionName` and formats drawer label as `v$versionName` | Settings spec says drawer footer/actions/version tap must stay unchanged ([0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):35); changing drawer label to include `versionCode` would alter existing behavior ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):74) | Medium |
| Drawer version tap path | Version label is a tap target for dev-mode sequence | Settings spec says settings footer is display-only and must not add dev-mode side effects ([0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):28); drawer path remains `onVersionTap` only through drawer footer ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):79) | Medium |
| About dialog | Drawer About dialog displays `Версия $versionName` | Spec excludes About dialog redesign and drawer action changes ([0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):48); current About dialog is local to `DrawerFooter` ([DrawerFooter.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt):85) | Low |
| Domain/data/storage | Feature spec says no domain/data contracts, repositories, storage, networking, or Koin bindings | No entity/DAO/data migration impact is required by spec ([0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):32) | Low |

