### Constraints / Risks / Open Questions

- Constraint: app-shell/settings UI should receive build metadata via parameters, because app-shell comments state library modules cannot access app `BuildConfig` directly ([AppShellScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt):107).
- Constraint: spec requires `v<versionName> (<versionCode>)`, e.g. `v0.1.0 (1)` ([0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):27).
- Constraint: current app layer passes only `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME`; `VERSION_CODE` is declared in Gradle but is not passed at the shown app-shell call site ([MainActivity.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt):43, [build.gradle.kts](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts):16).
- Risk: `DesignSettingsScreen` currently uses a full-size `LazyColumn`; spec requires footer pinned to visible bottom rather than just final short-list item ([DesignSettingsScreen.kt](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt):58, [0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):24).
- Open question: none found in spec for interactivity; display-only is explicitly specified ([0-spec.md](/Volumes/EXTERNAL/schoolquiz3.0/docs/features/settings-app-version-footer/0-spec.md):28).

